Template: karchi/timezone
Type: string
Default: Europe/Bratislava
Description: Time zone:
 As in /usr/share/zoneinfo, for example Europe/Bratislava or UTC.

Template: karchi/wifi-ssid
Type: string
Description: Wi-Fi network name:
 The server joins this network at every start. Leave it empty for no Wi-Fi:
 a cable works without any setting, and a network can be added later with
 "iwctl station wlan0 connect <name>".

Template: karchi/wifi-psk
Type: password
Description: Wi-Fi password:
 Leave it empty for a network without a password.

Template: karchi/tailscale-key
Type: string
Description: Tailscale auth key:
 With a key (tskey-auth-...) the server joins your tailnet by itself at its
 first start, with Tailscale SSH on. Leave it empty to log in later by hand:
 "sudo tailscale up --ssh".

Template: karchi/disk
Type: select
Choices: ${CHOICES}
Description: Where to install:
 A whole disk is erased with everything on it. "Free space" takes only the
 largest stretch of the disk that belongs to no partition and leaves every
 existing partition alone, so another system on it stays. One more
 confirmation follows. The medium this installer was started from is not in
 the list.

